{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>ותשליכני, ימים</b> — like על יאוריהם (upon their rivers). Yefet said: for the Sea of Reefs [Suf] mixes with the sea of Joppa, and סוף is like ותשם בסוף, because it [Joppa] is near."], :book :jonah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {0 "Yefet = Karaite exegete Ali ibn Suleiman; resolved by inference from the context of medieval commentators cited by Ibn Ezra."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Jonah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=19&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:10.565786829Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}